# ==== Benchmark / research outputs ====
# These are regenerated on demand via `python src/evaluate.py`
# (or `--replot-only` for just the figures). Not needed to use the
# core product, so they're kept out of version control.
benchmark/

# ==== Privacy: real / real-derived resume PDFs ====
# These sample resumes contain real employment history and identifying
# details. Keep the folder structure (via .gitkeep) but don't publish
# the actual files. Remove this rule if the repo is private and you're
# comfortable including them.
data/raw_resumes/*.pdf
!data/raw_resumes/.gitkeep
data/Resume.csv